        "text": "Commercial laundry repair means fixing the washing and drying machines themselves, when a washer won't drain, a dryer won't heat, or a coin-op unit stops working. Commercial laundry service (or linen service) means picking up dirty laundry and returning it clean. We do equipment repair, we fix your machines so they work again. We don't pick up or clean laundry."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Which areas of Southern California do you cover for commercial laundry repair?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Same-day across Los Angeles, Orange, Ventura, Santa Barbara, San Bernardino, Riverside, and San Diego counties, Koreatown, Hollywood, Long Beach LA-side laundromats and apartment buildings; Anaheim, Garden Grove, Costa Mesa OC laundromats; Thousand Oaks and Oxnard Ventura; Rancho Cucamonga, Riverside, and Ontario Inland Empire laundromats and multi-unit residential. Ten service territories total. Speed Queen, Dexter, Huebsch, Maytag Commercial. BHGS #A49573."
      }
