    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How quickly can you repair commercial laundry equipment?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Same day for most commercial laundry calls across all seven Southern California counties. Call before noon and we typically dispatch that day. For apartment buildings with tenant complaints, we prioritize to minimize the time tenants are without laundry access. For laundromats where down machines mean lost coin revenue, we route as priority. When you call, describe all machines needing service so we can bring the right parts for multiple repairs in one visit."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do you service all commercial laundry brands?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. Speed Queen, Dexter, Huebsch, Maytag Commercial, Continental Girbau, UniMac, Wascomat, Electrolux Professional, and Milnor are the brands we service most across Southern California laundromats and apartment buildings, all seven counties. Speed Queen parts are carried on service vehicles, Speed Queen is the dominant brand in Southern California's multi-family laundry market."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can you service multiple washers and dryers on the same visit?",
