<!-- HUB: WASHER + DRYER -->
<section class="section section-black">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-number">02, What We Fix</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Washers and dryers, separate systems, dedicated pages</h2>
    <p class="lead">Commercial washers and dryers have different failure modes and repair requirements. Click through for detailed information on each.</p>
    <p class="lead">Across the laundry equipment our techs service in LA, the failures split by machine type. On washers, not-draining leads (drain pump), then not-spinning (motor coupling or belt), then door-boot leaks, won't-start faults, and finally the drum bearing, the most expensive and the one that announces itself with a grinding spin. On dryers, vent restriction leads by a wide margin, then blown thermal fuses, heating elements and gas igniters, drive belts and idlers, and last the motor and drum bearing. Knowing which side of the room a symptom points to is half the repair, and it's why we keep the washer and dryer detail on dedicated pages.</p>

    <div class="hub-grid">
      <a href="/commercial/washer-repair/" class="hub-card">
        <span class="hc-icon">🫧</span>
        <h3>Commercial Washer Repair</h3>
        <p>Not draining, not spinning, water leak, door lock failure, error codes. Coin-operated and card-reader equipped machines. Multi-machine laundry rooms, apartment buildings, laundromats, hotels.</p>
        <div class="hc-issues">Common: drain pump · motor coupling · drum bearing · door gasket · water inlet valve · control board</div>
        <div class="hc-brands">Speed Queen · Dexter · Maytag Commercial · Continental Girbau · UniMac · Wascomat</div>
        <span class="hc-link">Commercial Washer Repair Details →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/commercial/" class="hub-card">
        <span class="hc-icon">🌬️</span>
        <h3>Commercial Dryer Repair + Vent Cleaning</h3>
        <p>Not heating, slow drying, burning smell, drum not turning. Fire safety, vent cleaning is the most overlooked commercial dryer maintenance. 80% of "not heating" calls are clogged vents.</p>
        <div class="hc-issues">Common: heating element · thermal fuse · drive belt · drum bearing · vent blockage · door switch</div>
        <div class="hc-brands">Speed Queen · Huebsch · Dexter · Maytag Commercial · Continental Girbau · ADC</div>
        <span class="hc-link">Commercial Dryer Repair Details →</span>
