    <p class="section-number">03, Who We Serve</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Every Southern California business and property that depends on commercial laundry equipment</h2>

    <div class="biz-grid">
      <div class="biz-card"><h3>🪙 Laundromats</h3><p>Coin and card-operated self-service laundromats. Down machines = immediate coin revenue loss. Multi-machine visits on one trip. $52–$90/machine/day at stake.</p></div>
